# 20. Common Errors

## FileNotFoundError

Reason

Wrong file path

Solution

Place the CSV file in the correct folder or provide the correct path.

---

## Wrong Separator

Suppose the file uses

```text
Name|Age|Marks
```

If you use

```python
pd.read_csv("students.csv")
```

Everything will appear in one column.

Solution

```python
pd.read_csv("students.csv", sep="|")
```

---

## Encoding Error

Example

```text
UnicodeDecodeError
```

Solution

```python
encoding="utf-8"
```

or

```python
encoding="latin-1"
```

